      "buDimFormula is monotone under divisibility: n ∣ m ∧ m ≠ 0 → buDimFormula n d ≤ buDimFormula m d",
      "The open conjecture buDim ≤ buDimFormula is equivalent to the statement that no exotic representations exist"
